flowchart TB
    Remote["REMOTE OPERATOR<br/>Approved identity + device"] --> Tailnet["TAILSCALE · DAILY PATH<br/>VM103 docker-host · 192.168.20.102"]
    subgraph Portal["DAILY MOBILE PORTAL"]
        direction TB
        Grant["OnePlus grant<br/>Split DNS · HTTPS443 · TCP8180–8209"]
        Proxy["Homepage fixed-target HTTPS proxy<br/>Scoped service destinations only"]
        PortalLimit["No SSH, direct InfluxDB<br/>or broad VLAN access"]
        Grant --> Proxy
        Proxy --- PortalLimit
    end
    subgraph Admin["APPROVED HOST ROUTES"]
        direction TB
        Routes["HA · 192.168.20.101/32<br/>Frigate · 192.168.30.20/32 · HTTPS8971<br/>OMV · 192.168.40.50/32<br/>Monitoring · 192.168.60.10/32 · 3000/3001"]
        RouteLimit["Identity + host firewall still apply<br/>No broad VLAN40 route<br/>No default public app exposure"]
        Routes --- RouteLimit
    end
    subgraph Fallback["DORMANT FALLBACK · NOT DAILY ACCESS"]
        direction TB
        WG["WireGuard client → OpenWrt<br/>Only through approved activation procedure"]
        WGScope["Split tunnel, narrow targets<br/>HA / OMV host access where required<br/>No broad storage subnet"]
        WG -.-> WGScope
    end
    Tailnet --> Portal
    Tailnet --> Admin
    Remote -.->|"separate activation gate"| Fallback
    class Remote,Tailnet,Grant,Proxy,Routes core
    class PortalLimit,RouteLimit policy
    class WG,WGScope deferred

    classDef core fill:#143747,stroke:#63c9bd,color:#eefbfa
    classDef store fill:#292745,stroke:#aa99db,color:#f2edff
    classDef policy fill:#2f301f,stroke:#c7bc77,color:#fff9d8
    classDef deferred fill:#1b2638,stroke:#9dabc1,color:#d3dfef,stroke-dasharray:5 4
